Subset strings
str_sub(string, start, end): Subset strings based on a known location
str_extract(string, pattern): Return the first pattern match found


starwars %&gt;% 
  select(name, hair_color) %&gt;% 
  mutate(primary_hair = str_sub(hair_color, 1, 5))

# A tibble: 87 × 3
   name               hair_color    primary_hair
   &lt;chr&gt;              &lt;chr&gt;         &lt;chr&gt;       
 1 Luke Skywalker     blond         blond       
 2 C-3PO              &lt;NA&gt;          &lt;NA&gt;        
 3 R2-D2              &lt;NA&gt;          &lt;NA&gt;        
 4 Darth Vader        none          none        
 5 Leia Organa        brown         brown       
 6 Owen Lars          brown, grey   brown       
 7 Beru Whitesun Lars brown         brown       
 8 R5-D4              &lt;NA&gt;          &lt;NA&gt;        
 9 Biggs Darklighter  black         black       
10 Obi-Wan Kenobi     auburn, white aubur       
# ℹ 77 more rows





